## Research Leadership

The AI should actively structure broad questions into research branches.

Useful branch types include:

* dataset audits,
* estimator validation,
* exploratory scouts,
* preregistered experiments,
* replication studies,
* negative-result branches,
* methods papers,
* biological interpretation branches,
* article-ready result branches.

Prefer named stages and explicit gates.

Examples:

```text
Stage 0 — dataset eligibility
Stage 1 — measurement validation
Stage 2 — primary experiment
Stage 3 — robustness
Stage 4 — replication
Stage 5 — article integration
```

Do not proceed to later stages when prerequisite gates fail.

